    "body": "Hi! Thanks for the request. I thought this was not a setting you can change in any BitTorrent client, but looking around, I see that qBittorrent started exposing the DHT bootstrap nodes as a setting in [5.0.0](https://www.qbittorrent.org/news#sun-sep-29th-2024---qbittorrent-v5.0.0-release)\r\n\r\nWould be an interesting feature, but I don't think I'll have the time to implement it anytime soon. PRs are welcome. I'll leave the issue open for now.",
